  "description": "dotnet new templates for Rulealize. `rulealize-plugin` creates a vocabulary: one plugin class, one worked example of each kind of node, and a rule set that calls them. `rulealize-avalonia-app` creates an Avalonia application made of a rule set and XAML, before either is written, with what an agent writing its rules is told and the commands that say when they are finished. `rulealize-aspnetcore-app` creates the same for ASP.NET Core, with rule sets and Razor screens.",
